    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Grid BFS / DFS</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Connected components</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/number-of-islands/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 200</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Number of Islands</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Count = how many times the scan finds land that no earlier flood has reached. Each find starts a flood fill (BFS/DFS) that sinks the whole island, so every cell is touched O(1) times: O(m·n) time.</p>\n"
